{"title":"What’s Wrong With Being the Villainess?","synopsis":"“Jadi memang kenapa kalau aku penjahatnya? Gaya hidup yang menyenangkan dan nyaman.”\n\nYoon Dohee bertransmigrasi ke dalam tubuh penjahat yang lahir dengan sendok perak di mulutnya dan berhasil mengubah hidupnya sepenuhnya.\n\nDengan tampang galak dan percaya diri yang sangat berbeda dengan kepribadian aslinya yang pemalu, ia menyempurnakan dirinya dengan memanfaatkan ilmunya sebagai mahasiswa di universitas bergengsi.\n\n‘Saya pikir sebagai penjahat saya hanya akan menemukan kebencian dan kematian cepat saya sendiri, tapi ini benar-benar jackpot!!!’","alternative_title":"악녀라서 편하고 좋은데요?","author":"Mang Go-Kim, Mindo","artist":"Yoteh","genres":["Comedy","Drama","Fantasy","Josei","Romance"],"chapters":[{"id":"1218af36-90bc-498f-aa09-8976d7e2b7c0","number":"101","title":"Chapter 101","date":"2026-07-29","images":[]},{"id":"b49a0ff2-95e5-4692-9237-5edff7b063f0","number":"100","title":"Chapter 100","date":"2026-07-25","images":[]},{"id":"9f1ebe3b-89cc-4e3c-a943-c8f170166fe2","number":"99","title":"Chapter 99","date":"2026-07-10","images":[]},{"id":"8faa3a90-d32c-4404-8779-17006e97e220","number":"98","title":"Chapter 98","date":"2026-07-02","images":[]},{"id":"178cd7b3-93da-418a-b3ae-a3de413bb1c6","number":"97","title":"Chapter 97","date":"2026-06-26","images":[]},{"id":"8b023a9f-1615-4c63-9f8e-0d3b19709640","number":"96","title":"Chapter 96","date":"2026-06-17","images":[]},{"id":"8fa8f23f-fcff-47b5-8041-dc241beaf613","number":"95","title":"Chapter 95","date":"2026-06-04","images":[]},{"id":"d0d1eb8b-a205-4676-8656-680e3e6fdd06","number":"94","title":"Chapter 94","date":"2026-06-04","images":[]},{"id":"be47501f-2e49-4877-8feb-3366ae55056b","number":"93","title":"Chapter 93","date":"2026-06-04","images":[]},{"id":"382b3636-535d-4035-8608-7f0fd356585f","number":"92","title":"Chapter 92","date":"2026-06-04","images":[]},{"id":"b46e6b82-7a72-4b42-a7e3-b6ef29ee0e05","number":"91","title":"Chapter 91","date":"2026